 "notes": "Fetched with WebFetch on 2026-10-13. The real store has no HTML site map; its sitemap.xml lists only locale roots and /game/buy-* pages, so the sitemap section mirrors the header menu tree plus the /view-all-games titles. www.rockstargames.com/privacy, /legal and /cookies render client-side (WebFetch returned only metadata), so those pages only expect their titles; take2games.com/ccpa was not fetched. Sign-in is an off-site Rockstar Games Account OAuth popup (signin.rockstargames.com), cart/checkout come from research/rockstar-store.md (live walkthrough 2026-09-29/30). The real store has no order-lookup, store-locator, gift-card or deals pages: order receipts/status live in Rockstar Support and Xsolla emails, so those page kinds are represented by the support articles. Product prices on other games, cards, bars and merch were seen but are not part of the reference catalog; the clone shows those pages read-only without purchase controls.",
